From abfb362958456799e07617cb6526263469f0df0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ParkWardRR <alfa147x@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 11:50:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/50] ews377ap-v3: wifi bring-up fixes from first hardware
 boot
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Real-hardware RAM boot showed ath11k requests qmi-board-id=255 (0xff, the
unfused id disambiguated by variant), path ath11k/IPQ8074/hw2.0/, then wanted
per-device cal-ahb-c000000.wifi.bin. Fixes:
1. ipq-wifi: add Build/Prepare to merge local files/ into PKG_BUILD_DIR — the
   git PKG_SOURCE unpack was clobbering it, so our board-2.bin never shipped.
2. board-2.bin: rekey to qmi-board-id=255,variant=EnGenius-EWS377AP-v3 (was 656).
3. ipq807x caldata hotplug: add engenius,ews377ap-v3 -> caldata_extract 0:art
   0x1000 0x20000 (per-device cal from ART/mtd11), matching ipq8071-ap8220.
---
 package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile            |  10 ++++++++++
 .../files/board-engenius_ews377ap-v3.ipq8074  | Bin 131232 -> 131184 bytes
 .../etc/hotplug.d/firmware/11-ath11k-caldata  |   1 +
 3 files changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile b/package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile
index 0c90726bc3..d44c6778bc 100644
--- a/package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile
+++ b/package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile
@@ -13,6 +13,16 @@ PKG_FLAGS:=nonshared
 
 include $(INCLUDE_DIR)/package.mk
 
+# This package pulls upstream board files from a git PKG_SOURCE, whose unpack
+# populates PKG_BUILD_DIR. Local override files under ./files/ (used by
+# install-overlay's $(PKG_BUILD_DIR)/board-<dev>.* wildcard) must be copied in
+# AFTER the default prepare, or they never ship. Without this, a board-<dev>.*
+# placed in files/ is silently ignored.
+define Build/Prepare
+	$(call Build/Prepare/Default)
+	$(if $(wildcard ./files/*),$(CP) ./files/. $(PKG_BUILD_DIR)/)
+endef
+
 define Build/Compile
 endef
 
diff --git a/package/firmware/ipq-wifi/files/board-engenius_ews377ap-v3.ipq8074 b/package/firmware/ipq-wifi/files/board-engenius_ews377ap-v3.ipq8074
